        "^": {"item": "ds-sleep-pod", "props": {"dir": "s", "title": "Sleep pod · induction", "kicker": "Dream studio", "flags": ["sawStudio", "sawInduction"], "sleeper": {"skin": "#e0c0a0", "hair": "#8a5a2a", "coat": "#8a8ea0"}, "ariadne": "SHE HAS BEEN ASLEEP FOR NINETEEN DAYS. I CANNOT WAKE HER.", "text": "POD 6 · INDUCTION\nSUBJECT 7 · L. HART (DONOR, RECEIVING)\nDAY 19 OF 30\n\nShe is asleep, and she is dreaming: her eyes move under the lids, fast, all the time. A screen on the lid plays her the board’s recordings, over and over, until she dreams them back.\n\nA note taped to the glass: “Her templates are cleaner than theirs. Ask Brandt about keeping her.”"}},
        ":": {"item": "ds-dream-console", "props": {"dir": "w", "title": "A. VOSS · REM CYCLE 2 · “THE PARTY”", "kicker": "Oneirography · playback", "flags": ["dreamVoss", "sawStudio", "sawProject"], "text": "A birthday. I am the guest of honour and I am very small.\n\nThe entertainer has three heads and they are all my father’s. One laughs at me. One cries for me. One sings, and doesn’t stop singing, even when the knives come out.\n\nEveryone claps. I clap too. It is the happiest I have ever been.\n\n(Transcriber’s note, F.A.: the subject laughed in his sleep for the whole of this cycle.)"}},
        "\"": {"item": "ds-dream-console", "props": {"dir": "w", "title": "M. THALE · REM CYCLE 3 · “THE COUNT”", "kicker": "Oneirography · playback", "flags": ["dreamThale", "sawStudio", "sawProject"], "text": "I am counting them and they will not hold still. Every time I reach a hundred, there is one more. They come up through the floor of the counting house and they are warm and they are all tied together at the tail, so if I count one I have to count them all.\n\nI am not frightened. I am behind."}},
        "@": {"item": "ds-dream-console", "props": {"dir": "w", "title": "I. BRANDT · REM CYCLE 5 · “THE NURSERY”", "kicker": "Oneirography · playback", "flags": ["dreamBrandt", "sawStudio", "sawProject"], "text": "The nursery is very clean. The nightlight is on. Something is under the cot, being patient.\n\nIt has very long arms. It waits until the baby stops crying. Then it pulls.\n\nI am not the baby. I am the mother, standing in the doorway, and I am not going to do anything. I am going to watch, carefully, so that I remember."}},
        "α": {"item": "ds-dream-console", "props": {"dir": "w", "title": "S. PELL · REM CYCLE 1 · “DINNER”", "kicker": "Oneirography · playback", "flags": ["dreamPell", "sawStudio", "sawProject"], "text": "A long table. Everyone is very well dressed and everyone is wearing my face, and the face is a mask, and under the mask there is no face, there is only a mouth, and the mouth is polite.\n\nThe main course is covered. Everyone waits for the gong. It is bad manners to start before the gong.\n\nI am the main course."}},
        "β": {"item": "ds-dream-console", "props": {"dir": "w", "title": "G. MOSS · REM CYCLE 4 · “THE KENNEL”", "kicker": "Oneirography · playback", "flags": ["dreamMoss", "sawStudio", "sawProject"], "text": "The dogs have no eyes and they know exactly where I am. They are smiling. They hold me down, gently, with their mouths, like retrievers with a bird, and they wait for someone to tell them they can stop.\n\nNobody tells them. I wake up before anybody tells them."}},
