        "δ": {"item": "ds-design-sheet", "props": {"face": "e", "art": "rats", "title": "Template 4-R · “The Count”", "kicker": "Dream studio", "flags": ["sawStudio", "sawProject"], "text": "TEMPLATE 4-R · “THE COUNT”\nSOURCE: M. THALE (REM 3)\nHOUSED: THE WARREN\n\nCommon rats (bred). A king forms at about four thousand: bound at the tails, it calls the rest.\nNOTE: M.T. asks for a daily count. The count is always wrong."}},
        "ε": {"item": "ds-design-sheet", "props": {"face": "e", "art": "hands", "title": "Template 4-U · “Under the bed”", "kicker": "Dream studio", "flags": ["sawStudio", "sawProject"], "text": "TEMPLATE 4-U · “UNDER THE BED”\nSOURCE: I. BRANDT (REM 5)\nHOUSED: THE NURSERY\n\nLong-limbed, nocturnal, ambush. Waits beneath furniture. Light makes it retreat, briefly.\nNOTE: it will not come out while you are watching the bed. Look away."}},
        "ζ": {"item": "ds-design-sheet", "props": {"face": "n", "art": "diner", "title": "Template 4-D · “Diner”", "kicker": "Dream studio", "flags": ["sawStudio", "sawProject"], "text": "TEMPLATE 4-D · “DINER”\nSOURCE: S. PELL (REM 1)\nHOUSED: THE LONG ROOM\n\nMasked (porcelain, from the dream). No face: a vertical mouth. Feeds on cue (the gong).\nNOTE: the masks are not removable. We tried."}},
        "η": {"item": "ds-design-sheet", "props": {"face": "n", "art": "hound", "title": "Template 4-G · “Grinner”", "kicker": "Dream studio", "flags": ["sawStudio", "sawProject"], "text": "TEMPLATE 4-G · “GRINNER”\nSOURCE: G. MOSS (REM 4)\nHOUSED: THE KENNELS · THE RUN\n\nPack hunter. Blind; hunts by breath. Bite holds. The dentition is human (adult, permanent): ask I.B. where from."}},
        "θ": {"item": "ds-hologram", "props": {"shape": "jester", "lunge": true, "lungeText": "The clown’s three heads turn to you at once, and it comes for you: straight through you, a rush of cold light. It was only light."}},
