        "τ": {"item": "ds-console", "props": {"dir": "s", "title": "G. Moss · incident log", "kicker": "Security Command", "flag": "mossLog", "once": false, "text": "G. MOSS · INCIDENT LOG · TONIGHT\n\n01:58 · ARIADNE flags external transmission (compliance). Director informed.\n02:13 · Line open. ARIADNE transmitting. Director orders me to cut it. I can’t: it’s routed through the AI’s own core.\n02:14 · Director executes Protocol LABRYS to stop ARIADNE’s external transmission. All lines severed. Core power cut. Robots to defence mode.\n02:14 · Containment failure on all floors. LABRYS opens containment; nobody on the board read that far.\n02:15 · The Director says it’s acceptable.\n02:16 · I said nothing.\n02:20 · Kwan asked why the dogs were out. I put her in the pens. She has the armory code; if she’s in the Run tonight, it goes with her.\n02:41 · The Director has picked tonight’s subject. The technician from the comms closet.\n\nI am writing it down so somebody knows I said nothing."}},
        "υ": {"item": "ds-note", "props": {"title": "A smock on a hook", "kicker": "Moss’s office", "text": "A child’s smock, pale blue with white spots, hung on a hook behind the door. It is far too big for any child: it would go round a car. It is the same pattern the Sitters wear on Floor 3.\n\nA label inside the collar, in careful capitals: G.M. AGE 6."}},
        "φ": {"item": "art", "props": {"face": "s", "title": "A photograph", "text": "The board on a terrace in the sun, glasses raised, laughing. Garrick Moss stands a little apart from the others, in a dark suit, not drinking. Behind them, out of focus, a building is on fire."}},
        "χ": {"item": "ds-monitors", "props": {"face": "s", "w": 3, "text": "CAMERA FEEDS · PRIVATE SUITES\n\nNURSERY · occupant restless\nPARTY ROOM · occupant restless · it is singing\nLONG ROOM · six guests seated · main course: live\n\nTHE RUN · subject tracking\nTHE BOX · feed to BOARDROOM (5): ON"}},
        "ψ": {"item": "ds-screen", "props": {"face": "e", "fragment": 7, "title": "A frozen security screen", "lines": ["SECURITY · DEFENCE MODE", "STAFF EXCEPTION: NONE", "AUTH: G. MOSS", "I KEPT THIS"]}},
        "ω": {"item": "ds-keypad", "props": {"face": "e", "code": "4471", "flag": "armoryOpen", "title": "Armory", "hint": "LAST SET BY: D. KWAN", "text": "The armory door unlocks with a heavy clunk."}},
