        "Ψ": {"item": "ds-kid-bed", "props": {"dir": "s", "eyes": "e", "until": "nurseryAwake", "lump": {"skin": "#e8c8a8", "hair": "#3a2418"}, "title": "Nadia Ferrante", "kicker": "The Nursery", "flags": ["sawNursery"], "text": "Nadia Ferrante, night nurse, according to the badge pinned to the duvet. A grown woman in a child’s bed, the covers pulled up to her chin and her knees up under them, because the bed is too short.\n\nHer eyes are open. Something has held her by the ankles, hard enough to leave the shape of its fingers, and then it pulled, and the bed is a long way from where it was."}},
