        "¢": {"item": "ds-music-box", "props": {"dir": "e", "until": "nurseryAwake", "flag": "woundMusicBox", "title": "The music box", "text": "A white music box with a ballerina on a spring. It plays a lullaby. The lullaby is the same three bars the Sitters hum on Floor 3, but here it is all of it, and it has words written inside the lid in a child’s hand:\n\nSTAY IN BED\nSTAY IN BED\nIT ONLY COMES OUT IF YOU GET OUT OF BED"}},
        "£": {"item": "ds-toy-box", "props": {"dir": "n", "title": "The toy box", "text": "Building blocks, a stuffed rabbit with its stuffing pulled out through the eyes, and a little set of plastic teeth, the joke kind that chatter. Every toy in it is clean and old and nobody has played with them."}},
