        "§": {"item": "ds-kid-drawing", "props": {"face": "s", "title": "A drawing", "text": "A drawing of a woman in a doorway, very tall, with her arms folded. MUMMY WATCHING. The face has been done in pencil and rubbed out and done again."}},
