        "»": {"item": "ds-body", "props": {"title": "Leon Marsh", "kicker": "The Party Room", "angle": 1.2, "color": "#2f3a4a", "skin": "#6a4a32", "hair": "#141010", "hat": true, "text": "Leon Marsh, security. Forty-one today, says a badge somebody pinned to his shirt: BIRTHDAY BOY. He is wearing a paper hat. He is wearing a handler’s exo-frame too, strapped over the uniform, which didn’t help him.\n\nThe frame is still good. It hums when you touch it."}},
        "¼": {"item": "ds-body", "props": {"title": "A guest", "kicker": "The Party Room", "angle": 2.4, "color": "#5a3a6a", "skin": "#d8b090", "hair": "#3a2418", "hat": true, "text": "A woman in a party dress, a paper hat, and a lanyard from Accounts. She has been laid back in her chair with her hands folded, as though she fell asleep at the table."}},
        "½": {"item": "ds-body", "props": {"title": "A guest", "kicker": "The Party Room", "angle": -0.4, "color": "#3a6a5a", "skin": "#c49a7a", "hair": "#1a1410", "hat": true, "text": "A lab tech in a paper hat. In one hand, still, a party blower, the kind that unrolls. There are a great many knives in the floor round him."}},
        "¾": {"item": "ds-body", "props": {"title": "A guest", "kicker": "The Party Room", "angle": -2.0, "color": "#6a4a2a", "skin": "#e0c0a0", "hair": "#8a5a2a", "hat": true, "text": "A man from Receiving in a paper hat. His party bag is in his lap. In it: a balloon, a sweet, and a single human tooth."}},
