        "Ä": {"item": "ds-gift", "props": {"color": "#5ad0ff", "loot": [{"type": "ammo", "ammo": "shells", "amount": 12}], "title": "A present", "text": "For the birthday boy. Inside, wrapped in tissue paper: a box of shotgun shells, and a card. “Many happy returns. — A.V.”"}},
        "Å": {"item": "ds-gift", "props": {"color": "#ff5ab0", "loot": [{"type": "item", "id": "ds-trauma-kit"}], "title": "A present", "text": "Inside: a trauma kit, the kind security carries. A card: “For afterwards. — G.M.”"}},
        "Æ": {"item": "ds-gift", "props": {"color": "#ffe04a", "loot": [{"type": "ammo", "ammo": "fuel", "amount": 60}], "title": "A present", "text": "Inside: a red can of fuel, a bow on top. No card."}},
        "Ç": {"tag": "partyStart"},
        "È": {"item": "ds-dining-table", "props": {"w": 14}},
        "É": {"item": "ds-cloche", "props": {"flag": "mainCourse", "title": "Under the cover", "captive": {"key": "Pryce", "name": "Martin Pryce", "refuge": "stairRefuge", "coat": "#e8e4dc", "skin": "#c49a7a", "hair": "#2a1a10", "saved": "Pryce. Martin. Night porter.\n\nThank you. Thank you. They laid the table at midnight. They said I’d have the best seat in the house, and they laughed, and then they put the cover on.\n\nThose things at the table aren’t the board. The board was going to watch. They watch everything from up there.", "body": "Martin Pryce, night porter, in a white jacket with a sprig of parsley still in the buttonhole. He made it as far as here."}, "text": "Under the cover, on a bed of greens, lies a man in a white waiter’s jacket, trussed at the wrists and the ankles, a linen napkin knotted in his mouth. He is alive.\n\nHis eyes go from you to the masked faces round the table, and back to you.\n\nThe masks have all turned to look at the two of you."}},
