        "Ô": {"item": "ds-place-card", "props": {"text": "TONIGHT\n\nAmuse-bouche\nConsommé\nThe main course (staff, live)\nA sorbet, to cleanse the palate\n\nGuests are asked not to begin before the gong."}},
        "Õ": {"item": "ds-place-card", "props": {"text": "GUEST · seat 4\n\nThe card is blank but for a seat number, and a small double axe printed in gold in the corner."}},
        "Ö": {"item": "ds-place-card", "props": {"text": "HOST · G. MOSS\n\nThe host’s chair has no straps. A handler’s helmet hangs over the back of it: Garrick likes to sit at the head of the table with a helmet in reach, a note under the card says. In case."}},
        "×": {"item": "ds-candelabra"},
        "Ø": {"tag": "dinnerZone"},
        "Ù": {"enemy": "ds-captive", "props": {"faction": "dormant", "key": "Kwan", "name": "Officer Dana Kwan", "coat": "#e0702a", "skin": "#c49a7a", "hair": "#1a1410", "saved": "Kwan. Security. Garrick’s. Was Garrick’s.\n\nThey put me in the cage at twenty past two, because I asked why the dogs were out. Sixteen years I worked for him.\n\nListen: the armory, off Security Command on the west side. The code is 4471. I set it myself. There’s a burner in there, and it’s the only thing the rats are afraid of.\n\nThe monitors in here show every one of the board’s private rooms. They were watching you. They’re always watching.", "body": "Officer Dana Kwan, security. They put the jumpsuit on over her uniform; you can see the collar.\n\nOn the back of her badge, in biro: ARMORY 4471."}, "tag": "contestants"},
        "Ú": {"enemy": "ds-captive", "props": {"faction": "dormant", "key": "Arden", "name": "Felix Arden", "coat": "#e0702a", "skin": "#e0c0a0", "hair": "#8a5a2a", "saved": "Felix Arden. I worked in the dream studios: I put the board to sleep and wrote down what they dreamed. That was the job.\n\nThe suites in the west wing are sets. The board dreams something, Brandt grows it, and they build it a room to live in, so it feels at home. Then they sit and watch it do what it’s for.\n\nThere’s a party in one of them. Don’t go to the party.", "body": "Felix Arden, oneirography. A pencil behind his ear and a notebook in his pocket, full of other people’s nightmares in his small neat hand."}, "tag": "contestants"},
        "Û": {"enemy": "ds-captive", "props": {"faction": "dormant", "key": "Soto", "name": "Marguerite Soto", "coat": "#e0702a", "skin": "#a8744a", "hair": "#2a1a10", "saved": "Peg. Peg Soto. I clean. Cleaned. They had me clean the Box last week: champagne all over the carpet, and the chairs turned round to face the glass.\n\nI thought it was a show. Like on television. I thought they were actors.\n\nThank you. I didn’t think anybody would come for us.", "body": "Marguerite Soto, night cleaning. Forty keys on her belt, for every door on this floor but the right one."}, "tag": "contestants"},
