        "ü": {"item": "ds-specimen-file", "props": {"dir": "n", "title": "The count", "kicker": "Rat Warren", "flags": ["fileRats", "sawProject"], "text": "TEMPLATE 4-R · DAILY COUNT · FOR M. THALE\n\nMON 3,212 · TUE 3,388 · WED 3,951 · THU 4,104\nFRI: a king has formed (approx. 12 bound at the tail). The count is now uncertain. M.T. has been informed. M.T. asked us to count again.\nSAT: counted again. 4,112.\nSUN: counted again. 4,112. Every time. It is always 4,112, however many we take out.", "ariadne": "SHE COUNTS THE DONORS THE SAME WAY."}},
