        "ă": {"item": "ds-trial-console", "props": {"dir": "n"}},
        "Ą": {"item": "ds-betting-board", "props": {"face": "n", "w": 3, "flags": ["sawBets"], "ariadne": "THEY BET ON YOU FROM UPSTAIRS. THE BOX HAS A FEED TO THE BOARDROOM.", "text": "TRIAL 14 · TONIGHT · PRIVATE BOOK\n\nA.V. ...... subject survives the Run ...... 5,000\nM.T. ...... under three minutes ........... 40,000\nI.B. ...... the contestants first ......... 2,000\nG.M. ...... the dogs ....................... 10,000\nS.P. ...... no bet (“I am not a gambler”)\n\nHOUSE NOTE: the subject is the Director’s own selection.\nPARTNERS ATTENDING: none (lockdown). BOARD ATTENDING: remotely."}},
        "ą": {"item": "ds-monitors", "props": {"face": "w", "w": 2, "text": "THE BOX · FEEDS\n\nNURSERY · PARTY ROOM · LONG ROOM · THE RUN · THE ARENA\n\nOne feed is outgoing, not incoming: BOX → BOARDROOM (FLOOR 5). Its light is on."}},
